# .gitignore
# Root of the IntraDay repository.
# Established at Checkpoint 3 (Technology Mapping, Repository Governance &
# Implementation Blueprint) alongside Git initialization. Purpose: ensure
# secrets, local environment state, and generated/ephemeral artifacts never
# enter version control, per docs/architecture/TECHNOLOGY_MAPPING.md §12
# (Security Architecture) and §13 (Configuration Architecture).

# --- Secrets & environment ---
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
secrets/
*.secret

# --- Python ---
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
*.egg-info/
.eggs/
.venv/
venv/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.pytest_cache/
.coverage
htmlcov/
dist/
build/

# --- Poetry ---
poetry.lock.bak

# --- Node / frontend ---
node_modules/
frontend/**/dist/
frontend/**/build/
.vite/

# --- Django ---
staticfiles/
media/

# --- Databases / local data (never commit real trading or market data) ---
*.sqlite3
*.db
data/**/*.parquet
data/**/*.csv

# --- Docker ---
*.env.docker

# --- IDE / OS ---
.vscode/
.idea/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# --- Logs ---
*.log
logs/

# --- Generated contracts (regenerated by CI, not hand-maintained;
#     tracked exception: keep committed snapshots so drift is diffable —
#     see docs/architecture/TECHNOLOGY_MAPPING.md §9. Do NOT ignore
#     frontend/shared/generated_contracts — it must stay committed.)
# Checkpoint 9: the raw OpenAPI schema is an intermediate build artifact,
# not the committed contract (the generated TypeScript in
# frontend/shared/generated_contracts is) — regenerated on demand by
# `npm run generate:api`, never committed.
/openapi.json
frontend/openapi.json

# TypeScript incremental build cache — machine/build-local, never committed.
frontend/tsconfig.tsbuildinfo
